87647560","conversation_id":"2110310987689512978","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:05:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110310987689512978"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/wY18PNUN1M","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/mattschneidman/status/2110310987689512978/video/1","media_key":"13_2110310881858834435","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/wY18PNUN1M"}]},"id":"2110310987689512978","lang":"en","note_tweet":{"text":"Micah Parsons on his podcast, The Edge: “The biggest thing that people worried about with me, they're like, 'Man, why ain't he back yet?' If the Super Bowl was this week, I'm playing in the Super Bowl. But it's just about me making sure I have all the small things fixed first. What a lot of people don't figure out is it's not just the ACL. It's like, why did the ACL happen? What was weak? Because it all works together. It's a chain. And throughout the history of ACL, they notice if you come back early, there tends to be an overcompensation injury on the other side ... we just gon' make sure everything is right before. Because everyone knows, it's like, what's the point of getting me back for four weeks and then next thing you know, my groin bothering me.”"},"possibly_sensitive":false,"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":137,"impression_count":350229,"like_count":2760,"quote_count":46,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":114},"text":"Micah Parsons on his podcast, The Edge: “The biggest thing that people worried about with me, they're like, 'Man, why ain't he back yet?' If the Super Bowl was this week, I'm playing in the Super Bowl. But it's just about me making sure I have all the small things fixed first. https://t.co/wY18PNUN1M"}],"users":[{"created_at":"2008-09-22T14:34:18.000Z","description":"National Insider for ESPN and NFL Network. Husband of @LeahRaps. Made seven cameos in the movie Draft Day.","id":"16403943","location":"New York","name":"Ian Rapoport","public_metrics":{"followers_count":5166672,"following_count":854,"like_count":4784,"lis